  <header class="page">
    <p class="crumb"><a href="{{ '/projects/' | relative_url }}">Projects</a></p>
    <h1>Sensing Place: Measuring Urban Function &amp; Deprivation</h1>
    <p class="dek">Methods for inferring what urban places are for, how intensely they are used, and where disadvantage concentrates, from landscape form, human activity, and street-level imagery.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="figrow" style="grid-template-columns:0.899fr 0.823fr">
    <figure class="fig-full">
      <div class="plate"><a class="figure-link" href="{{ '/assets/img/projects/sensing-place-function/ecolind_landscape-to-function.jpg' | relative_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/projects/sensing-place-function/ecolind_landscape-to-function.jpg' | relative_url }}" alt="Three pairs of images: a high-resolution satellite view beside the urban landscape derived from it, for residential, commercial, and public and service areas" width="1906" height="2120" loading="eager" decoding="async"></a></div>
