    <div class="paper">
      <div class="thumb"><a class="figure-link" href="{{ '/assets/img/projects/sensing-place-function/ceus2020_commercial-topics.jpg' | relative_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/projects/sensing-place-function/ceus2020_commercial-topics.jpg' | relative_url }}" width="1370" height="954" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Open full-resolution paper figure"></a></div>
      <div>
        <p class="cite"><span class="yr">2020</span> &nbsp; Xing, H., &amp; <b>Meng, Y.*</b> Revealing deep semantic commercial patterns: insights from urban landscape depiction. <i>Computers, Environment and Urban Systems</i>, 79, 101404.<span class="role">corresponding</span></p>
